<view class="page"><view class="brand"><view class="brand-mark">鸭</view><view><view class="brand-name">上岸鸭</view><text class="brand-sub">原账号数据会保留</text></view></view><view class="eyebrow">BIND YOUR PHONE</view><view class="title">绑定手机号并设置新密码</view><view class="desc">验证本人手机号后，手机号将绑定到刚刚验证的原账号。原任务、资料和记录不会迁移到新账号。</view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">手机号</text><view class="input-wrap"><text class="prefix">+86</text><input class="input" type="number" maxlength="11" placeholder="请输入常用手机号" value="{{phone}}" bindinput="onPhone"/></view></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">短信验证码</text><view class="code-wrap"><view class="input-wrap"><input class="input" type="number" maxlength="6" placeholder="输入6位验证码" value="{{code}}" bindinput="onCode"/></view><button class="code-btn" bindtap="send" disabled="{{countdown>0}}">{{countdown>0?countdown+'秒后重发':'获取验证码'}}</button></view></view><view class="primary" wx:if="{{!verified}}" bindtap="verify">验证手机号</view><block wx:if="{{verified}}"><view class="field"><text class="field-label">设置新密码</text><view class="input-wrap"><input class="input" password placeholder="至少8位，包含字母和数字" value="{{password}}" bindinput="onPassword"/></view></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">确认密码</text><view class="input-wrap"><input class="input" password placeholder="再次输入密码" value="{{confirm}}" bindinput="onConfirm"/></view></view><view class="primary" bindtap="bind">绑定并进入工作台</view></block></view>